Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.07,0:03:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That dream again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.41,0:03:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kujo, Jotaro, age 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:03:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Height, six foot four.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,His father's Japanese, a jazz musician,\Nis currently on an overseas concert tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,His British-American mother visits\Nevery day to try and persuade him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and there are a countless number\Nof personal items inside of his cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.09,0:04:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.69,0:04:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Those gang members, just punks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But he put eight of them\Nin the hospital by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite that fact, we've\Ntold them he's free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does he refuse to leave? He's a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.83,0:04:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Squatting in a place like this,\Nwhat is he trying to accomplish?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.71,0:05:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, it's Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.43,0:05:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Holly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.99,0:05:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.93,0:05:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He had a run-in with\Nsome local gang members,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.15,0:05:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,got into a fight, and\Nwas thrown into jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The police officer told me that\Nthey'll release him and that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.11,0:05:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I should make him stay home\Nto reflect on what he's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.17,0:05:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But he refuses to leave\Nuntil he discovers the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,true nature of the evil\Nspirit that haunts him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.35,0:05:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Evil spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.53,0:05:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.01,0:05:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're certain that Jotaro\Nsaid evil spirit? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.37,0:06:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fly over right away to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.83,0:06:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going home for sure today, Cujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.91,0:06:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandson is coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandson?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.47,0:06:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You even dragged that old man into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Jotaro, don't you dare\Naddress your mother that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.55,0:06:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And is that the attitude you have\Ntowards your own grandfather after
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.09,0:07:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come all the way from New York\Nfor the first time in ten years?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.91,0:07:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.91,0:07:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming home with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.73,0:07:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, please listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your grandfather\Ncan help you with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.31,0:07:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think you can help me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You do not understand the terrible\Nnature of this evil spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he have...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.11,0:07:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.43,0:08:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.25,0:08:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.05,0:08:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Another hand, it came out of\NJotaro and stopped the bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.51,0:08:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You could see that hand too, Holly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.97,0:08:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Any strange sensations?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:08:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.91,0:09:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.09,0:09:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we'll just step outside\Nand leave this matter to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.33,0:09:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if we were the only\Nones who could see that hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.69,0:09:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain it all later, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.49,0:09:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, we have to get\NJotaro out of this cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.19,0:09:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man, you don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.05,0:09:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.61,0:09:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this, and then run along home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.61,0:09:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My artificial hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He managed to make a fool out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.73,0:09:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, though, his abilities\Nare greater than I ever imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.03,0:09:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I don't think he'll\Nbe convinced by words alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.69,0:09:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,To force him to prepare for\Nthe danger he's going to face,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.77,0:10:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro must be made to\Nunderstand physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I met my friend Avdol here\Nthree years ago in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.67,0:10:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol, force my grandson\NJotaro out of this cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.55,0:10:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, I may have to be\Na little rough with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.41,0:10:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.47,0:10:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Do what you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.01,0:10:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be strong, but\Nthere's no way you can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.39,0:10:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, what is he going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.57,0:11:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that thing you call an evil spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.61,0:11:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol has one as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol's will controls this evil spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.09,0:11:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Its name is Magician's Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,An evil spirit you can\Ncontrol with your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.87,0:11:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The evil spirit can be controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.05,0:12:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so at last it reveals\Nits full form to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.91,0:12:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not think he could\Nmaterialize it so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to go easy on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But he is more powerful than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a chance my life is at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.17,0:12:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you still insist on having me\Nforce your grandson out of there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,he may end up in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.87,0:12:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.37,0:13:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Grant! Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.07,0:13:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Garth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What could they possibly\Nbe doing to cause this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If you weaken, the evil spirit weakens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.07,0:13:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Chotaro, the true nature of\Nwhat you call an evil spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,is a manifestation of the\Npower of your life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.07,0:13:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,From the way it appears and stands\Nbeside you, we call this vision a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.65,0:13:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, how's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now will you step out of that cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.63,0:13:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.27,0:14:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep this up and you're\Ngonna pay with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.39,0:14:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.69,0:14:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The iron bars are bending\Nall by themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.51,0:14:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you turn away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.59,0:15:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's no longer in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.51,0:15:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like I've been outwitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.61,0:15:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.43,0:15:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I intended to have you\Nleave here on a stretcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.69,0:15:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,However, your stand's power\Nwas greater than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.95,0:15:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What if...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.99,0:15:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,this so-called stand of mine had\Nactually thrown that iron bar at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.93,0:15:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what would you have done then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.87,0:15:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A flimsy iron bar like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.25,0:15:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Magician's Red would have\Nvaporized that bar in mid-air.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.57,0:15:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Chodro,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.48,0:16:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,your stand is a special\Npower that has awakened
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,because you're going to need it very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain it all to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.45,0:16:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:17:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this is the story of the destiny\Nbestowed upon the Joestar family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.47,0:17:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,About four years ago, in the Atlantic\NOcean off the coast of Africa,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,a
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.59,0:17:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,sturdy iron casket was
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.09,0:17:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,salvaged from a shipwreck
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.43,0:17:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,On the ocean floor, my\Ngrandfather Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.37,0:17:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,joestar died on the\Npassenger ship that was
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,transporting the casket\Nthat much has been confirmed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,when it was found and opened\Nthere was nothing inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.90,0:17:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm absolutely certain that\Nit once contained the body
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,of the man that Avdol and\NI are still searching for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.05,0:18:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to tell\Nme this guy's body was
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,at the bottom of the\Nocean for a hundred years?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.43,0:18:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.77,0:18:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been talking about this guy\Nas if you think he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that man, the very incarnation\Nof evil, is alive and walking among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.67,0:18:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He has awakened from\Nhis hundred-year sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.59,0:18:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We must seek out and destroy\Nthis man at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.95,0:18:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It is our destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.53,0:18:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly, did you find what I asked for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.87,0:18:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But what are you going\Nto do with it, Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.85,0:18:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.76,0:19:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,about a year ago, I discovered that a\Nstand ability had developed in me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.71,0:19:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand ability...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,is this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.69,0:19:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There. Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.51,0:19:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Those brambles that appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my stand ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.67,0:19:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermit purple, it transfers\Nvisions onto film.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Psychography,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the image that is about to appear on\Nthat film, will determine your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly, please show us what's on the\Nleft side of the nape of your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.49,0:19:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This star-shaped birthmark\Nis the star of our destiny,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.15,0:19:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,which the Joestar family cannot escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.51,0:20:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother told me that my father,\Nwho died when I was still a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.77,0:20:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,had that birthmark as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this birthmark have to\Ndo with that psychography of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.87,0:20:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That is Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the only one who\Never appears on the film.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.85,0:20:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at the birthmark\Non the nape of his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It shows that the bastard's body,\Nfrom the neck down, is my grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.69,0:20:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonathan Joestar's body,\Nwhich Dio has taken over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.55,0:21:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Again...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.51,0:21:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, I sensed that\Nsomeone was watching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.99,0:21:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be Jonathan's descendants?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.53,0:21:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible this body is sending\Nsome signals to his descendants?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.81,0:22:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That man, at this very moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.05,0:22:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hiding somewhere in the\Nworld and searching for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.79,0:22:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Four years have gone by since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.75,0:22:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that Mai and Jotaro's\Nstands both appeared within
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.17,0:22:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,one year probably has something\Nto do with Dio's resurrection.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.41,0:22:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Our stand abilities are what\Nthe world would refer to as ESP.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.01,0:22:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I was somehow born with these abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.11,0:22:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but your stands are\Nconnected to Dio's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.63,0:22:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, you are linked to\NJonathan's body by invisible threads.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably Dio's existence brought\Nforth your latent powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.59,0:22:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol, from this photograph, can you\Ndetermine where Dio is hiding right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.53,0:22:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.35,0:23:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But, as before, the background\Nshows only darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.09,0:23:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could see through that darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.65,0:23:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.13,0:23:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to have found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.87,0:23:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.43,0:23:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A fly? What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You found a fly somewhere\Nin that darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.23,0:23:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:24:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,let's send this to the\NSpeedwagon Foundation
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.51,0:24:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,right away so they can\Ninvestigate this fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.99,0:24:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.29,0:24:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,this may help us narrow down the number of
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.29,0:24:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,places where Dio could\Nbe hiding right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.75,0:24:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.87,0:24:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly, please fax this right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.01,0:24:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I will
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.59,0:24:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hermit card. Wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.61,0:24:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wariness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.55,0:24:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Esotericism.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.46,0:24:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Magician card. The\NQuestioner. Diplomacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.39,0:25:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And the key is this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.27,0:25:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the star card, Hope, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.99,0:26:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.63,0:27:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.55,0:27:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
